T8b C7 / moq-dev/moq#4613 diagnostic instrumentation for moq-mux, against upstream main 5124f8134.
Logs every interleave hold (target diag4613: start, lagging tracks, expiry, catch-up) and every
consumer skip with its lag, and reads MOQ_TS_HOLD_MS to override the hold budget (0 = arrival order).
Apply with: git apply t8b-4613-diag.patch   (git apply ignores this preamble). Not for upstream.

